## Additional Context
The release workflow (.github/workflows/release.yml) already generates and pushes the Homebrew formula to jbctechsolutions/homebrew-skillrunner. Your task is to create a local script (scripts/update-homebrew.sh) that can manually update the Homebrew formula for local testing or manual releases. The script should: 1) Take a version tag as argument, 2) Download the release artifacts from GitHub, 3) Calculate SHA256 checksums, 4) Generate a proper Homebrew formula Ruby file, 5) Optionally push to the homebrew-skillrunner repo. Also create a template formula file that documents the expected structure.

Begin implementing the feature now.